## Project Structure

```
ds_{{ project }}/
├── src/
│   └── {{ project }}/
│       ├── common_utils/       # Shared utility functions
│       ├── dataflow/
│       │   ├── config/         # Dataset column config (cat_cols, onehot_cols, thresholds)
│       │   ├── features/       # Feature engineering classes
│       │   │   └── transformers/
│       │   └── preprocess/     # Data loading, validation, transformation
│       └── models/
│           └── {{ model }}/    # One directory per model
│               ├── config/     # Hyperparameter search space (hyper_config.py)
│               ├── training/   # Tuning, evaluation, model training
│               └── inference/  # Batch scoring
└── pyproject.toml
```

